Text:
A bit of a hike going there and our driver was not overly keen since it was a small dirt road but we loved wandering around the garden snapping away at the different vistas and 'rooms', mosquitoes are definitely loving seeing tourists there but manageable. As for the house, the 'keeper' was not overly enthusiastic in his commentary but we enjoyed it anyway...
Mr Bawa's was obviously was a bit of an eccentric who loved to be surrounded by beautiful things and people but
if the sight of a statue of a male naked & a few lascivious pictures are too much for you...don't bother (then don't bother with many other parts of the world, italy, greece, india... and BTW don't bother with art all together !)
